{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Butter Side Down is a bizarro choose-your-own-choice game. Starring Basil Bonser, Adam Spargo, Grey Michael, Beatrice, Jeep Johnson, and Rotten Ruggerio. Answer questions, take calls, play card games, and solve one hell of a mystery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An All Star Cast:</strong> Basil Bonser, Adam Spargo, Grey Michael, Beatrice, Jeep Johnson, Rotten Ruggerio, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legendary Factions:</strong>\u00a0The F.A.C.T.S. Department, The Money Men, Da Union, and The Company Of Jesters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The BC-3:</strong>\u00a0A fully-featured, period-accurate virtual computer.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Question Answering:</strong>\u00a0Your choices will  determine the ultimate fate of your coworkers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phone Calls:</strong> Call your coworkers. Receive calls from strangers. It\u2019s fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Games:</strong> Play classic card games like Sacrimoni Slap and Brannigan\u2019s Wager.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SNDSCP-305:</strong>\u00a0A soundtrack built dynamically based on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> There are 45 endings. Or more?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Hell Of A Mystery:</strong>\u00a0Join the hunt for the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And More:</strong> Extras, secrets, and achievements.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"That's Classified","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812580/7855a6d89e2becee91031458713f9ee556f44c96.jpg"},{"name":"One Small Step For Alien","path":"https://cdn.aka